# stepping — fuel suspension and resumption (§Q6/§Q8): an exhausted phrase
# rolls its session surface back but stays SUSPENDED at the exhaustion point;
# `:step N` resumes it with a fresh budget and the resumed trace covers the
# whole phrase. Also pinned: E9155 when nothing is suspended, re-suspension
# on a second exhaustion, and a real submit discarding the suspension.
# (`@repeat` is the CLI's list-test shorthand — the phrase is `0 1 + 1 + …`.)
:fuel 10
0 @repeat 40 [1 + ]
:stack
:step 500
:stack
:step 500
:fuel 10
@repeat 40 [1 + ]
:step 20
:step 20
0 @repeat 40 [1 + ]
:step 20
: double ( i64 -- i64 ) dup + ;
:step 20
